    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d848">

                <pb facs="1343" n="1329" sameAs="frus:frus1944v01/pg1329"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00116 European War 1939/1470</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Miss K. Isabel Poate,
                        an Attaché of the British Embassy, to Miss Katherine B.
                            Fite, Assistant to the Legal Adviser</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Hackworth</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-06-12">June 12, 1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Miss Fite</hi>: As agreed between you and Mr.
                    Gore-Booth on the telephone, and confirmed in Mr. Hackworth’s letter to Mr.
                    Gore-Booth of June 9th, (Le 740.00116 European War 1939/1459), we have drawn up
                    a draft directive on the subject of the jurisdiction of the military commanders
                    in the field over war crimes, which might serve as a basis for discussion at the
                    proposed meeting of representatives of the Department of State, the War and Navy
                    Departments, and this Embassy. Three copies of this proposed draft are enclosed
                    herewith.</p>
                <p>Perhaps you would telephone, either to Mr. Gore-Booth or myself, as soon as a
                    date and time for the meeting has been arranged?<anchor n="58" xml:id="d848-f1"
                    />
                </p>
                <p>Yours sincerely,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>K. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Isabel Poate</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d848-a1.xml" xpointer="d848-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d848-f1" n="58" xml:id="d848-f1-content">
                <p>No record of the meeting found in Department files; it was evidently held on July
                    7.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
